OL,3,GNEWSAPride and sadness as domestic
OL,4,Aabuse charity closes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe boss of a domestic abuse charity
OL,7,Fwhich has been forced to close due to a
OL,8,Ffunding crisis has said she was
OL,9,F"bereft" but proud of its work over
OL,10,Fmore than 30 years.
OL,12,FVida, in Sheffield, had been supporting
OL,13,Fvictims in the city since starting up
OL,14,Fin the mid-1990s as the Sheffield
OL,15,FDomestic Violence Forum.
OL,17,FThe charity, which in its final years
OL,18,Femployed six part-time staff as well as
OL,19,Fvolunteers, had about 200 referrals a
OL,20,Fyear and was supporting 60 women at the
OL,21,Ftime of its closure in the summer.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
