OL,3,GNEWSAPride and sadness as domestic
OL,4,Aabuse charity closes
OL,5,
OL,6,FKaren Hague, Vida's chief executive,
OL,7,Fsaid the closure, which was announced
OL,8,Fin June, had been "hard to process" due
OL,9,Fto the administrative tasks surrounding
OL,10,Fits winding up.
